WEBVTT

00:00:00.556 --> 00:00:01.764 line:87%
Your new kitchen is here.

00:00:01.836 --> 00:00:03.620 line:87%
Over three hundred pieces—

00:00:03.756 --> 00:00:05.519 line:87%
and suddenly,
your garage is full.

00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:06.564 line:87%
Cabinet feet,

00:00:07.122 --> 00:00:07.626 line:87%
lights,

00:00:08.369 --> 00:00:09.236 line:87%
hinges…

00:00:09.986 --> 00:00:10.981 line:87%
Where do you start?

00:00:11.181 --> 00:00:12.758 line:87%
Let SKI reconcile
your inventory.

00:00:12.816 --> 00:00:14.515 line:87%
We check your delivery
against your order,

00:00:14.608 --> 00:00:16.307 line:87%
so you can focus
on your new kitchen.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:19.100 line:87%
Upload your plans to SKI.
